	<section class="entry">
	    <div class="wpb-content-wrapper" id="wpb-content-root"><div id="single-page-hero" data-vc-full-width="true" data-vc-full-width-temp="true" data-vc-full-width-init="false" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_custom_1485752763042 vc_row-has-fill"><div class="contact-info wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12"><div class="vc_column-inner vc_custom_1485430038782"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h1 style="text-align: left;">DISLOCATIONS</h1>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row-full-width vc_clearfix"></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-8"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>Dislocation is a bone that has been removed from a joint. This can happen spontaneously or from trauma and may have associated fractures.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h3>Treatment</h3>
<ul>
<li>Follow the Basic First Aid Plan to assess the casualty</li>
<li>Check for circulation in the injured limb.</li>
<li>DO NOT TRY TO PUT THE DISLOCATION BACK IN PLACE.</li>
<li>If an Ambulance is required &#8211; call immediately</li>
<li>Splint or sling injured part if possible.</li>
<li>Consider applying bulky padding over the site.</li>
<li>Apply cold pack to reduce swelling, elevate injured part if possible.</li>
<li>Seek medical aid.</li>
</ul>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h2>Signs and Symptoms</h2>
<ul>
<li>Pain</li>
<li>Inability to move</li>
<li>Deformity</li>
<li>Tenderness over joint.</li>
<li>Swelling and discolouration around the joint occurs rapidly.</li>
</ul>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div>
</div>	</section><!-- /.entry -->
